@startuml
title Order lifecycle (FR-02)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> CREATED : create order
CREATED --> CONFIRMED : confirm / reserve stock
CREATED --> CANCELLED : cancel / no stock release
CONFIRMED --> PICKING : start picking
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : cancel / release reserved stock
PICKING --> SHIPPED : create shipment
SHIPPED --> IN_TRANSIT : simulate pickup
IN_TRANSIT --> DELIVERED : simulate delivery
DELIVERED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
@enduml
